      "writtenOn": "2026-02-11T16:10:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```\nif (*startLayer) {\n            fLayers.addAfter(targetLayer, *startLayer);\n} else {\n            fLayers.addToTail(targetLayer);\n}\n```\n\nNote: the bug only starts to show up in the CL where depth draws are added to the general case. I\u0027m still not sure why this happens.",
      "parentUuid": "0a7fedcc_270f55c2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 230,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 233,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "6f0032f8e6c5ec66269a7c7ae5d34a7f0614d1a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2a4da22a_250885ac",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/DrawListLayer.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 48
      },
      "lineNbr": 233,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T18:19:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this may be because that CL was using `addToHead` to keep all the depth-only draws in front of the shading draws which use `addToTail`. When we switch to `addAfter` here, we start to interleave the depth draws and these shading draws?",
      "parentUuid": "56882fad_24088679",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 230,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 233,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "6f0032f8e6c5ec66269a7c7ae5d34a7f0614d1a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2f0044f8_24945037",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/DrawListLayer.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 48
      },
      "lineNbr": 233,
      "author": {
        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-13T15:57:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That shouldn\u0027t be possible. If the draw was affected by later depth draws (and thus causing interleaving i.e. Start at A; A - insert - B) the starting layer must have been incorrect (i.e. the forward walk should have started at B).",
      "parentUuid": "2a4da22a_250885ac",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 230,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 233,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "6f0032f8e6c5ec66269a7c7ae5d34a7f0614d1a8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
